This product includes a modified copy of "ndef-emulator"
(https://github.com/LuigiVampa92/ndef-emulator) by LuigiVampa92,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Changes made to that library (ndefemulation/):
- Optional expiry time for the emulated data; the HCE service stops
  answering once it has passed.
- A read counter and a broadcast (ACTION_NDEF_READ) sent each time a
  reader has fully read the NDEF message.
- A short cooldown after a complete read so a reader does not open the
  same content twice.

The original demo application was replaced by the NFC Share app (app/).
